# A valid Claude specification stop is a CORRECT outcome: the supplied GPT
# specification could not be applied honestly, and Claude stopped rather than
# inventing what it did not settle. It is never a PASS, and it is never worked
# around by asking Claude to invent something. It goes back to GPT.
#
# So after a stop the disposable-workspace proof agrees with, ONE fresh,
# read-only, ephemeral GPT review of the actual current sources classifies it.
# Claude's own stop report is EVIDENCE ONLY in that review, exactly as an audit
# finding is: it says what Claude believed, and it proves nothing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

