    "behaviour is undecided.\n"
    "IF THE USER-FACING BEHAVIOUR IS SETTLED AND ONLY HOW TO IMPLEMENT IT "
    "REMAINS OPEN, classify the issue as mechanically_implied or "
    "mechanical_work, whichever the sources warrant, and carry the ordinary "
    "required source witness for that classification exactly as you would for "
    "any other. This instruction changes only how you CLASSIFY. It settles no "
    "N.H policy, it decides no design, and it is not a reason to drop an issue "
    "from the inventory: every issue is still classified and still accounted "
    "for.\n"
    "\n"
    "DO NOT REOPEN SETTLED WORK\n"
    "Do not raise an issue as genuinely open because a different design is "
    "imaginable, because an older file used different wording, or because you "
    "would have chosen otherwise. If current source answers it, it is settled.\n"
    "\n"
    "OPEN-ANSWER QUESTION RULE\n"
    "A genuine Ness question identifies one unresolved decision dimension; it "
    "does not restrict Ness to the reference options in this payload. The "
    "options exist so their already-known consequences can be checked safely. "
    "They are examples, never an exhaustive answer form. Do not create a false "
